      "text": "Purple spiritual light is a rank seven immortal material. It is not gathered from white heaven; it originates from deep underground ores. Xia clan holds the most purple spiritual stone lodes in the five regions and treats this trade as its number one source of revenue, keeping firm dominance over the business.",
